  "holistic_F_N": 0,
  "holistic_F_H": 0,
  "section_notes": "The final standard adopts strong incident reporting (24h/10d, 72h customer notice) and a 55°C test with 5% limit but allows a 180-day corrective-action/retest window during which sales continue unless imminent risk. It mandates remote shut-off on new units and a 6-year retrofit deadline, built-in fire suppression from 36 months, and a mandatory recall at 8 incidents/100k with a flexible regulator-overseen remedy and prompt customer notices."
